  These files are copied **unmodified**. The interpreter that runs locally is therefore
  the interpreter that runs on Kaggle, which is the only reason a local score means
  anything. They are not vendored here as a submodule because the upstream repository
  contains twenty-one other environments and their visualisers, and this project needs
  one of them.

  `AGENTS.md` and `README.md` are also served by the competition itself at
  https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/kaggriculture/data, gated behind accepting the
  competition rules. They are identical files; the sizes match byte for byte (13,708 and
  26,824 bytes). The copy here came from the public repository, not from the competition.

