2. One function from kaggle-environments
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  File:    vendor/kaggle_environments/utils.py
  Source:  https://github.com/Kaggle/kaggle-environments
           kaggle_environments/utils.py
  Function: resolve_episode_seed
  Licence: Apache License 2.0
  Holder:  Copyright 2022 Kaggle, Inc.

  The environment's only dependency outside the Python standard library is this one
  function. It is vendored so that `env/kaggriculture.py` can be imported unmodified
  without installing the full `kaggle-environments` package, which requires jax,
  transformers, open_spiel, pettingzoo and pygame — and pygame has no wheel for
  Python 3.14 and does not compile here without SDL2 development headers.

